The patch modifies the `while` condition to include a safeguard on `in`, ensuring that it does not exceed the size of the input buffer (`p->size`):
```c
while ((out < (comp_Prebuf.size + uncompressedSize)) && (in < p->size))
```

This prevents the loop from iterating past the end of the input buffer, avoiding the out-of-bounds reads.

