The vulnerable logic resides in the incorrect bounds-checking of `sig_len` in relation to the signature's position within the `ServerKeyExchange` message. The patch correctly modifies the condition to ensure proper parsing and validation. By isolating this slice, we focus on the precise part of the code responsible for the vulnerability and its fix.

