The vulnerability lies in the absence of a check for buffer overflows during the log writing process. Specifically, the code does not adequately ensure that the `len` variable (representing the current length of the log buffer) does not exceed `FPM_LOG_BUFFER`. This oversight can result in a buffer overflow, potentially allowing attackers to execute code or crash the application.

