  1. Introduced a new variable (`remaining`) to store intermediate frame size calculations.
  2. Added logic to check if the result of `avpriv_dnxhd_get_frame_size(cid)` or `dnxhd_get_hr_frame_size(cid, dctx->w, dctx->h)` is valid.
